None is “the prime support of $pi$.”  They are related projections of one
formulation path.  Chudnovsky supplies another ecology whose fixed scale
$
  640320=2^6 dot 3 dot 5 dot 23 dot 29
$
has a different valuation face while returning the same invariant.

